    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「おまえら、どういう繋がりだよ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「ともあれ、どうにか追っ手を振り切りまして。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「ナガマチさんに案内されてこの神社に逃げ延びてきた、というわけですよぉ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「にょ～ん、九死に一生を得ましたよぉ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「炬燵でゴロゴロ……これぞお正月のあるべき姿ですよぉ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「努力などアホのすることっ、わたしは絶対がんばらないでござる！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
