    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「ふぅん。脱走ね……そんなキツいのかよ、演劇部は」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「キツいなんてもんじゃないですよぉ、地獄ですよ地獄！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「以前、牧場での強化合宿がそこそこ成果をだしましたからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「うちの部長……瓶底メガネが、味を占めたみたいなんですよぉ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「だから冬休みを利用した、『第二回☆地獄の牧場合宿』が開催されてしまったわけですよぉ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「真冬の牧場で、朝から晩まで強制労働させられるんですよぉ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「おまけに演劇の練習もさせられて……こんなの、ふつうに虐待ですよぉ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「いつか訴えてやる～っ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「しかも、次の舞台は時代劇らしくて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
